#N canvas 20 20 2760 2120 12;
#X text 20 20 u_tempo -- the master reference: the master BPM \, the pulse oscillator MIDI clock is cut from \, and the transport. Not the clock: anything that needs a beat owns a c_clock. ref/module/tempo.md, f 58;
#X text 20 140 creation args: none. inlets: none. outlets: none. It talks on tempo \, clock \, start \, stop \, panic \, disp and err \, and out of three MIDI ports: two carry the clock and the transport \, and a third takes panic's STOP alone., f 58;
#X obj 20 300 r tempo;
#X obj 20 345 t f f;
#X obj 20 400 clip 5 600;
#X obj 20 445 t f f f;
#X obj 450 470 s \$0-clamped;
#X obj 250 505 s \$0-bpm;
